LOOP

COMMENT
Date: 2026-09-23
Title: Test FM with DDS4 with DIGITAL channel 3 as trigger
Notes:
- EOM freq has code 48
- EOM amp has code 49
- hop frequency at from 9.9 MHz to 10 MHz

Rising time BCO measurement setup with SA:
- set centerfrequency on SA to 6830 MHz
- AMPT -> set amplitude scale to linear and autoscale
- SPAN -> set zero Span
- SWeep/Trig -> set Trigger Type to External, Mode to Cont
- SWeep/Trig -> set Time to 4 ms
ENDCOMMENT

INIT
Trigger EOM = Off                                                      (3)
EOM Amp = [20]                                                         (49)
EOM Freq = 9.9 MHz                                                   (48)
ENDINIT

INNER
+1ms            EOM Freq = 9.9 MHz                                         (48)
+1s             Trigger = On                                                 (3)
+500us           EOM Freq = 10.0 MHz                                       (48)
+1s            Trigger = Off                                                (3)
ENDINNER

ITERATIONS 10

ENDLOOP
